    3 times damage to targets with Debuffs.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Weak
    Point\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.flood\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
