    damage dealt by 0.8% for every 1% of the hero's remaining HP, up to 80%.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.power-strike\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
