    damage dealt by 75% of the hero's Crit Damage above 100%. This attack cannot
    critically hit.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.quell\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Quell\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Increases
    damage dealt by 50% per Stance on the hero.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.amplify\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Amplify\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Increases
