    Technique\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Increases damage
    dealt by 20% per card belonging to the hero in hand.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"SecretTechnique\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.absorb-energy\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
