    Energy\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Removes 3 Power Gauge
    orbs from the target, deals additional damage equal to 30% of their Max HP, and
    heals the hero by the additional damage dealt.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"AbsorbEnergy\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.dot-burst\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
