    damage over time equal to 45% of damage dealt at the end of the affected target's
    turn.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.explosion\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Explosion\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Deals
    delayed damage based on damage dealt.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Explodes\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.stun\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
