    stance statuses and their dependent effects. Prevents all actions for the duration.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Stuns\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.paralyze\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Paralyze\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Removes
    stance statuses and their dependent effects. Prevents all actions for the duration.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Paralysis\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.freeze\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Freeze\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Applies
    after the triggering action finishes. Removes and blocks non-grey statuses, including
    neutral Stance and healing effects. Prevents card use and all HP recovery. An
    attack triggers Shatter and breaks the ice; otherwise expires after the next
    target turn. Has a hidden Freeze recovery cooldown.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Frozen\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.frost-bite\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Frost
    Bite\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Pierce -15 percentage
    points and Power Gauge generation -50% while active. Deals 64% of triggering
    HP damage at target turn end.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.dissolve\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Dissolve\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Removes
    the displayed number of Power Gauge orbs at the affected enemy's turn end.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.conductive\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Conductive\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Defense
    -20% per stack; up to three stacks. Lisa can consume these stacks for bonus damage.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.baron-bunny\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Baron
    Bunny\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Explodes with Pyro damage
    only on natural expiry. Cleansing safely cancels it; the explosion can react
    and applies ordinary Ignite independently of its neutral Pyro aura.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.glacial-waltz\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Glacial
    Waltz\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Once per incoming attacking
    card, retaliates with Cryo damage equal to 15% of HP lost and heals 30% of retaliation
    HP damage. Only Kaeya receives its 30% damage reduction.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.melody-loop\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Melody
    Loop\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Attack +7%. Heals 6%
    of Barbara's snapshotted Max HP at the start of each protected ally's turn.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.swirl\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Swirl\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Preserves
    source setup and spreads one fresh elemental contact to occupied adjacent enemy
    slots. That contact can react.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.crystallize\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Crystallize\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Grants
    a two-turn barrier equal to 30% of actual Geo HP and shield damage, capped at
    100% of the Geo actor's Max HP.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.superconduct\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Superconduct\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Deals
    1.5x level-based Cryo reaction damage with DOT Damage Dealt bonuses to the target
    and adjacent enemies. Increases non-elemental damage taken by 40% for 2 target
    turns; cannot refresh.\"}],\"Aliases\":[],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.electro-charged\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
    keyword\",\"GameplayDefinitionId\":\"\",\"StyleId\":\"style.keyword\",\"Names\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Electro-Charged\"}],\"Definitions\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Deals
    1.5x level-based Electro reaction damage with DOT Damage Dealt bonuses at target
    turn end for 2 turns. Preserves auras and spreads to adjacent Hydro enemies.
    Cannot refresh.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Charged\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.overload\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
