    2x level-based Pyro reaction damage with DOT Damage Dealt bonuses to the target
    and adjacent enemies. Their shields absorb this damage at 80% efficiency.\"}],\"Aliases\":[{\"Locale\":\"en\",\"Text\":\"Overloaded\"}],\"Deprecated\":false,\"Tooltip\":null},{\"Id\":\"keyword.attack.melt\",\"Revision\":1,\"Category\":\"Attack
